<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11548" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crĕper</span></b> , ĕra,
			ĕrum, adj.
		Sabine; kindr. with Sanscr. kshapā, night, and Gr.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνέφας</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>dusky, dark;</i>
			hence, trop., <i>uncertain, obscure, doubtful,
			wavering</i> (ante- and post-class.), <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 6, § 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7, §
			77</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">Non. p. 13, 15 sq.</span></i>;
			Paul. ex <i><span class="en">Fest. p. 52, 18</span></i> Müll.
			*</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, only <i>subst.</i>:
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crĕpĕrum</span></b> , i,
			n., <i>darkness</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">noctis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Symm. Ep. 1, 7</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: res, Pac. ap.
				<i><span class="en">Non. p. 13, 29</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Att.
				ib. p. 21 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Varr. 1</span></i>. 1.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">belli certamina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 1295</span></i>
			: oracla, Varr. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. p. 14,
			4</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
